WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,590
Let’s eat first and then pick up Mommy’s instant noodles

2
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:12,910
I actually thought she was not nutritious before.

3
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,910
Don’t talk about instant noodles later.

4
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,910
A mouthful of hot soup costs your life.

5
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:22,100
hot

6
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:25,380
There is meat and eggs

7
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:29,660
This is how it feels after eating a full meal

8
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:40,110
Three months later these things

9
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,110
Everything will become a scarce commodity

10
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:42,110
Cool oil inside

11
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,110
meat vegetables

12
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:44,110
water medicine

13
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:45,110
And warm clothes

14
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,110
generator fuel

15
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:47,110
means of transportation

16
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:49,940
things that money can buy

17
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,940
I have to prepare in advance, right?

18
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:52,940
And a house and a car

19
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:53,940
Could it be that everything is scrap iron and scrap bricks from now on?

20
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,940
Now you can sell it in exchange for supplies

21
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:59,500
Pick up grandma first

22
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:02,200
After coming back

23
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,200
Calculate how much money I have left now

24
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:07,630
last life

25
00:01:07,630 --> 00:01:08,630
I want two anti-inflammatory pills

26
00:01:08,630 --> 00:01:10,630
I gave the last bit of supplies I had to others.

27
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:14,240
In the end, it still left such a long scar

28
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,240
this life

29
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,240
I want to take the medicine

30
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,240
I want to swallow the food

31
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:18,240
Even a needle

32
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,240
I won't be short again

33
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:28,110
this time

34
00:01:28,110 --> 00:01:30,180
Mom will never lose you again

35
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:37,040
Now 50 kilograms of rice only costs more than 100 yuan

36
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:39,040
A box of antipyretics costs dozens of yuan

37
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:40,040
Two yuan for a bottle of water

38
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,040
three months later

39
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,040
You can't buy these things with money

40
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,740
There's still enough time

41
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:45,740
As long as you move quickly enough

42
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:47,740
Momo and I can survive

43
00:01:47,740 --> 00:02:16,370
Mom just misses you so much
